Package: ggfigurestudio
Title: Interactively Edit, Arrange, and Export ggplot Figures
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Project", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Edit ggplot figures in a local Shiny interface. Select and style
    plot elements, adjust labels and axes, add annotations, and customize
    themes and palettes. Arrange multiple plots in one image, save editable
    projects, and export figures using grid graphics.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ggplot2, shiny, grid, jsonlite, svglite, systemfonts, rlang, withr, RColorBrewer
Suggests: colorspace, cowplot, DESeq2, ggpubr, ggrepel, ggthemes, metan, rrBLUP, sf, statgenSTA, SummarizedExperiment, terra, xml2
